    "A simplification factor has to work on both numbers exactly.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-53e4d6a6016f7d81.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"A"},{"atMs":259.6,"durationMs":824.5,"text":"simplification"},{"atMs":1097.3,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"factor"},{"atMs":1443.1,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"has"},{"atMs":1655.8,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"to"},{"atMs":1775.5,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"work"},{"atMs":2121.3,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"on"},{"atMs":2294.2,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"both"},{"atMs":2626.6,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"numbers"},{"atMs":2972.3,"durationMs":585.1,"text":"exactly"}],"durationMs":3557},
