    "A uses one common factor. Here's the check.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-0cd684defa6f0ac7.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"A"},{"atMs":272.9,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"uses"},{"atMs":711.7,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"one"},{"atMs":1030.8,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"common"},{"atMs":1389.9,"durationMs":545.2,"text":"factor"},{"atMs":2855.8,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"Here's"},{"atMs":3161.7,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3268.1,"durationMs":492,"text":"check"}],"durationMs":3760},
