    "Changing a sign makes an opposite. A reciprocal has a different job: it makes a product of one.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-f6a0e37923805fbf.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"Changing"},{"atMs":618.6,"durationMs":53.2,"text":"a"},{"atMs":685.1,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"sign"},{"atMs":1097.3,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"makes"},{"atMs":1403.2,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"an"},{"atMs":1536.2,"durationMs":598.4,"text":"opposite"},{"atMs":3055.3,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"A"},{"atMs":3214.9,"durationMs":625,"text":"reciprocal"},{"atMs":3853.2,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"has"},{"atMs":4039.4,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"a"},{"atMs":4145.8,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"different"},{"atMs":4597.9,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"job"},{"atMs":5103.2,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"it"},{"atMs":5209.6,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"makes"},{"atMs":5502.1,"durationMs":66.5,"text":"a"},{"atMs":5581.9,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"product"},{"atMs":5980.8,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"of"},{"atMs":6073.9,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"one"}],"durationMs":6446},
    "Changing only one number does not make an equivalent fraction.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-2648f08b08d06d46.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"Changing"},{"atMs":645.2,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"only"},{"atMs":911.2,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"one"},{"atMs":1230.3,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"number"},{"atMs":1562.8,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"does"},{"atMs":1762.2,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"not"},{"atMs":1988.3,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"make"},{"atMs":2227.7,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"an"},{"atMs":2334,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"equivalent"},{"atMs":2852.7,"durationMs":638.3,"text":"fraction"}],"durationMs":3491},
    "Changing only one number does not preserve the fraction. Here's the check.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-32e6ffc7f6b25434.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":518.6,"text":"Changing"},{"atMs":631.9,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"only"},{"atMs":871.3,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"one"},{"atMs":1190.4,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"number"},{"atMs":1549.5,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"does"},{"atMs":1748.9,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"not"},{"atMs":1975,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"preserve"},{"atMs":2400.5,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2493.6,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"fraction"},{"atMs":4026.1,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"Here's"},{"atMs":4331.9,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":4438.3,"durationMs":492,"text":"check"}],"durationMs":4930},
    "Changing only the denominator changes the fraction’s value.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-ee609dcb1f08186c.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":545.2,"text":"Changing"},{"atMs":658.5,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"only"},{"atMs":911.2,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1044.2,"durationMs":704.8,"text":"denominator"},{"atMs":1762.2,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"changes"},{"atMs":2227.7,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2334,"durationMs":545.2,"text":"fraction’s"},{"atMs":2892.5,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"value"}],"durationMs":3371},
