    "Dividing both numbers by seven gives three quarters.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-af93902ea74b3509.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":558.5,"text":"Dividing"},{"atMs":671.8,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"both"},{"atMs":964.4,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"numbers"},{"atMs":1323.4,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"by"},{"atMs":1496.3,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"seven"},{"atMs":1855.3,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"gives"},{"atMs":2174.5,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"three"},{"atMs":2467,"durationMs":678.2,"text":"quarters"}],"durationMs":3145},
    "Dividing by two means finding one of two equal shares - one half of the amount.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-cb8086adf84d1606.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":558.5,"text":"Dividing"},{"atMs":671.8,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"by"},{"atMs":858,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"two"},{"atMs":1177.1,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"means"},{"atMs":1522.9,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"finding"},{"atMs":1935.1,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"one"},{"atMs":2121.3,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"of"},{"atMs":2241,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"two"},{"atMs":2533.5,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"equal"},{"atMs":2932.5,"durationMs":518.6,"text":"shares"},{"atMs":3703.7,"durationMs":266,"text":"one"},{"atMs":3983,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"half"},{"atMs":4315.4,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"of"},{"atMs":4408.5,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":4528.2,"durationMs":492,"text":"amount"}],"durationMs":5020},
    "Dividing by two means make two equal shares of the three eighths.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-05d074f350f9c65d.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"Dividing"},{"atMs":645.2,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"by"},{"atMs":818.1,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"two"},{"atMs":1110.6,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"means"},{"atMs":1469.7,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"make"},{"atMs":1735.6,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"two"},{"atMs":1975,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"equal"},{"atMs":2413.8,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"shares"},{"atMs":2826.1,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"of"},{"atMs":2919.2,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3012.2,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"three"},{"atMs":3344.7,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"eighths"}],"durationMs":3850},
    "Dividing only the denominator changes the value. Here's the check.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-e1835a1c1a0f835f.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"Dividing"},{"atMs":645.2,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"only"},{"atMs":897.9,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1030.8,"durationMs":691.5,"text":"denominator"},{"atMs":1735.6,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"changes"},{"atMs":2214.4,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2320.8,"durationMs":492,"text":"value"},{"atMs":3733.5,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"Here's"},{"atMs":4039.4,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":4145.8,"durationMs":492,"text":"check"}],"durationMs":4638},
