    "Forty-five divided by five is nine; nine times two is eighteen metres.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-7af5ad5bfaf19796.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":664.9,"text":"Forty-five"},{"atMs":778.2,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"divided"},{"atMs":1256.9,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"by"},{"atMs":1443.1,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"five"},{"atMs":1881.9,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"is"},{"atMs":2054.8,"durationMs":359,"text":"nine"},{"atMs":2600,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"nine"},{"atMs":2905.8,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"times"},{"atMs":3331.4,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"two"},{"atMs":3623.9,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"is"},{"atMs":3850,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"eighteen"},{"atMs":4302.1,"durationMs":585.1,"text":"metres"}],"durationMs":4887},
    "Forty-five divided by five is nine.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-05e57c0851c29c82.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":704.8,"text":"Forty-five"},{"atMs":818.1,"durationMs":492,"text":"divided"},{"atMs":1323.4,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"by"},{"atMs":1509.6,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"five"},{"atMs":1975,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"is"},{"atMs":2147.9,"durationMs":492,"text":"nine"}],"durationMs":2640},
    "Forty-two divided by seven is six, and seventy divided by seven is ten.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-7e9c538142acb395.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":691.5,"text":"Forty-two"},{"atMs":804.8,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"divided"},{"atMs":1296.8,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"by"},{"atMs":1483,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"seven"},{"atMs":1881.9,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"is"},{"atMs":2068.1,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"six"},{"atMs":2759.6,"durationMs":133,"text":"and"},{"atMs":2905.8,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"seventy"},{"atMs":3331.4,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"divided"},{"atMs":3823.4,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"by"},{"atMs":4022.9,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"seven"},{"atMs":4435.1,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"is"},{"atMs":4608,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"ten"}],"durationMs":5047},
    "Forty-two divided by six is seven.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-ca395120df7a67bd.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":731.4,"text":"Forty-two"},{"atMs":844.7,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"divided"},{"atMs":1336.7,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"by"},{"atMs":1536.2,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"six"},{"atMs":1921.8,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"is"},{"atMs":2108,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"seven"}],"durationMs":2547},
    "Forty-two thirtieths divides by six to make seven fifths.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-b6a57c1abd8aa531.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":664.9,"text":"Forty-two"},{"atMs":778.2,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"thirtieths"},{"atMs":1323.4,"durationMs":492,"text":"divides"},{"atMs":1828.7,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"by"},{"atMs":2014.9,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"six"},{"atMs":2360.6,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"to"},{"atMs":2480.3,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"make"},{"atMs":2733,"durationMs":359,"text":"seven"},{"atMs":3105.3,"durationMs":638.3,"text":"fifths"}],"durationMs":3744},
    "Four and two ninths is a mixed number greater than one.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-92449fc5249c8908.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":266,"text":"Four"},{"atMs":379.2,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"and"},{"atMs":498.9,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"two"},{"atMs":738.3,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"ninths"},{"atMs":1137.2,"durationMs":133,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1283.5,"durationMs":66.5,"text":"a"},{"atMs":1363.3,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"mixed"},{"atMs":1695.8,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"number"},{"atMs":1988.3,"durationMs":359,"text":"greater"},{"atMs":2360.6,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"than"},{"atMs":2533.5,"durationMs":359,"text":"one"}],"durationMs":2892},
    "Four becomes eight by multiplying by two. Use the same factor on the numerator: one becomes two.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-148dce45bb563cbc.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"Four"},{"atMs":326.1,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"becomes"},{"atMs":764.9,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"eight"},{"atMs":964.4,"durationMs":133,"text":"by"},{"atMs":1110.6,"durationMs":731.4,"text":"multiplying"},{"atMs":1855.3,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"by"},{"atMs":2081.4,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"two"},{"atMs":3507.5,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":3853.2,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3959.6,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"same"},{"atMs":4265.4,"durationMs":359,"text":"factor"},{"atMs":4637.8,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"on"},{"atMs":4797.3,"durationMs":66.5,"text":"the"},{"atMs":4877.1,"durationMs":691.5,"text":"numerator"},{"atMs":5847.9,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"one"},{"atMs":6047.3,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"becomes"},{"atMs":6512.8,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"two"}],"durationMs":6898},
    "Four becomes eight with times two. The numerator must use that same times two.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-d57522751372ec35.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"Four"},{"atMs":299.5,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"becomes"},{"atMs":725,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"eight"},{"atMs":911.2,"durationMs":133,"text":"with"},{"atMs":1057.5,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"times"},{"atMs":1483,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"two"},{"atMs":2789.4,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"The"},{"atMs":2975.5,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"numerator"},{"atMs":3600.5,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"must"},{"atMs":3906.4,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"use"},{"atMs":4159,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"that"},{"atMs":4345.2,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"same"},{"atMs":4664.4,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"times"},{"atMs":5116.5,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"two"}],"durationMs":5489},
    "Four columns cut one way and five rows cut the other way.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-e6b292f7503ad39a.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"Four"},{"atMs":299.5,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"columns"},{"atMs":711.7,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"cut"},{"atMs":977.7,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"one"},{"atMs":1230.3,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"way"},{"atMs":1536.2,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"and"},{"atMs":1709,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"five"},{"atMs":2161.2,"durationMs":359,"text":"rows"},{"atMs":2533.5,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"cut"},{"atMs":2759.6,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2879.2,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"other"},{"atMs":3092,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"way"}],"durationMs":3518},
