    "Match each phrase to first quantity over second quantity, then simplify.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-a319d4aa91c972a7.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"Match"},{"atMs":512.2,"durationMs":266,"text":"each"},{"atMs":791.5,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"phrase"},{"atMs":1150.5,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"to"},{"atMs":1256.9,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"first"},{"atMs":1669.2,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"quantity"},{"atMs":2161.2,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"over"},{"atMs":2413.8,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"second"},{"atMs":2826.1,"durationMs":492,"text":"quantity"},{"atMs":3557.5,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"then"},{"atMs":3756.9,"durationMs":744.7,"text":"simplify"}],"durationMs":4502},
    "Matching denominators is useful for adding or subtracting fractions.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-f4de91013ce32f8b.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"Matching"},{"atMs":565.4,"durationMs":744.7,"text":"denominators"},{"atMs":1323.4,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1509.6,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"useful"},{"atMs":1961.7,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"for"},{"atMs":2134.6,"durationMs":359,"text":"adding"},{"atMs":2506.9,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"or"},{"atMs":2626.6,"durationMs":678.2,"text":"subtracting"},{"atMs":3318.1,"durationMs":771.3,"text":"fractions"}],"durationMs":4089},
    "Maya's rule changes the value. No one multiplier links both pairs of numbers.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-05463638a9a3bed1.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"Maya's"},{"atMs":618.6,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"rule"},{"atMs":937.8,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"changes"},{"atMs":1429.8,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1522.9,"durationMs":492,"text":"value"},{"atMs":2935.6,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"No"},{"atMs":3228.2,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"one"},{"atMs":3520.8,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"multiplier"},{"atMs":4145.8,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"links"},{"atMs":4451.6,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"both"},{"atMs":4797.3,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"pairs"},{"atMs":5116.5,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"of"},{"atMs":5222.9,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"numbers"}],"durationMs":5835},
    "Mixed numbers are written differently.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-b76c8f25223060da.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"Mixed"},{"atMs":498.9,"durationMs":359,"text":"numbers"},{"atMs":871.3,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"are"},{"atMs":977.7,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"written"},{"atMs":1363.3,"durationMs":638.3,"text":"differently"}],"durationMs":2002},
    "More pieces in the whole means each piece is smaller. It does not automatically mean more of the whole.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-2a1cabb10d5f1598.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"More"},{"atMs":366,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"pieces"},{"atMs":791.5,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"in"},{"atMs":897.9,"durationMs":66.5,"text":"the"},{"atMs":977.7,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"whole"},{"atMs":1296.8,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"means"},{"atMs":1616,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"each"},{"atMs":1921.8,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"piece"},{"atMs":2241,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"is"},{"atMs":2427.1,"durationMs":571.8,"text":"smaller"},{"atMs":3919.7,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"It"},{"atMs":4132.5,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"does"},{"atMs":4318.6,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"not"},{"atMs":4571.3,"durationMs":718.1,"text":"automatically"},{"atMs":5302.7,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"mean"},{"atMs":5608.5,"durationMs":266,"text":"more"},{"atMs":5887.8,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"of"},{"atMs":5994.2,"durationMs":66.5,"text":"the"},{"atMs":6073.9,"durationMs":492,"text":"whole"}],"durationMs":6566},
    "Multiples of four are four, eight, twelve.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-45998102cb30ab7e.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":638.3,"text":"Multiples"},{"atMs":751.6,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"of"},{"atMs":844.7,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"four"},{"atMs":1150.5,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"are"},{"atMs":1270.2,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"four"},{"atMs":1908.5,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"eight"},{"atMs":2413.8,"durationMs":625,"text":"twelve"}],"durationMs":3039},
    "Multiples of three are three, six, nine, twelve.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-5cbb3d417d6a6be7.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":651.6,"text":"Multiples"},{"atMs":764.9,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"of"},{"atMs":884.6,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"three"},{"atMs":1230.3,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"are"},{"atMs":1429.8,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"three"},{"atMs":2108,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"six"},{"atMs":2719.7,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"nine"},{"atMs":3437.8,"durationMs":625,"text":"twelve"}],"durationMs":4063},
