    "Multiply eight by three and keep the pieces as elevenths.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-c8930e1368764779.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":638.3,"text":"Multiply"},{"atMs":751.6,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"eight"},{"atMs":937.8,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"by"},{"atMs":1123.9,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"three"},{"atMs":1589.4,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"and"},{"atMs":1722.3,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"keep"},{"atMs":1961.7,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2068.1,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"pieces"},{"atMs":2506.9,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"as"},{"atMs":2639.9,"durationMs":625,"text":"elevenths"}],"durationMs":3265},
