    "Nine equals nine, so nine ninths is an improper fraction equal to one.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-d33478066f8354ea.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"Nine"},{"atMs":578.7,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"equals"},{"atMs":1044.2,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"nine"},{"atMs":1576.1,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"so"},{"atMs":1735.6,"durationMs":359,"text":"nine"},{"atMs":2108,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"ninths"},{"atMs":2467,"durationMs":133,"text":"is"},{"atMs":2613.3,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"an"},{"atMs":2719.7,"durationMs":492,"text":"improper"},{"atMs":3225,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"fraction"},{"atMs":3717,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"equal"},{"atMs":4116,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"to"},{"atMs":4235.6,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"one"}],"durationMs":4674},
    "Nine is already a multiple of three. Change the thirds, then add.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-0120b54df45190fe.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"Nine"},{"atMs":592,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"is"},{"atMs":751.6,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"already"},{"atMs":1230.3,"durationMs":53.2,"text":"a"},{"atMs":1296.8,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"multiple"},{"atMs":1815.4,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"of"},{"atMs":1908.5,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"three"},{"atMs":3294.7,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"Change"},{"atMs":3706.9,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3813.3,"durationMs":545.2,"text":"thirds"},{"atMs":4531.4,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"then"},{"atMs":4730.8,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"add"}],"durationMs":5077},
    "Nine ninths counts all nine ninth-sized parts of one whole.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-55504012d9be14cf.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"Nine"},{"atMs":512.2,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"ninths"},{"atMs":844.7,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"counts"},{"atMs":1230.3,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"all"},{"atMs":1496.3,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"nine"},{"atMs":1828.7,"durationMs":651.6,"text":"ninth-sized"},{"atMs":2493.6,"durationMs":359,"text":"parts"},{"atMs":2866,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"of"},{"atMs":2959,"durationMs":266,"text":"one"},{"atMs":3238.3,"durationMs":492,"text":"whole"}],"durationMs":3730},
    "Nine ninths is improper and exactly one.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-0fba729bb482d9b1.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"Nine"},{"atMs":525.5,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"ninths"},{"atMs":911.2,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1084,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"improper"},{"atMs":1602.7,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"and"},{"atMs":1775.5,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"exactly"},{"atMs":2241,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"one"}],"durationMs":2653},
