    "One stops before the one-whole checkpoint. One is written as a single fraction but carries on past one. The last one tells us the completed wholes first.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-ece0eddb1e089d39.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"One"},{"atMs":459,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"stops"},{"atMs":858,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"before"},{"atMs":1190.4,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1310.1,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"one-whole"},{"atMs":1828.7,"durationMs":744.7,"text":"checkpoint"},{"atMs":3494.2,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"One"},{"atMs":3853.2,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"is"},{"atMs":4012.8,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"written"},{"atMs":4371.8,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"as"},{"atMs":4504.8,"durationMs":66.5,"text":"a"},{"atMs":4584.6,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"single"},{"atMs":4996.8,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"fraction"},{"atMs":5488.8,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"but"},{"atMs":5661.7,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"carries"},{"atMs":6140.4,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"on"},{"atMs":6300,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"past"},{"atMs":6698.9,"durationMs":359,"text":"one"},{"atMs":7975.5,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"The"},{"atMs":8135.1,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"last"},{"atMs":8520.8,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"one"},{"atMs":8786.7,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"tells"},{"atMs":9145.8,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"us"},{"atMs":9265.4,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":9371.8,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"completed"},{"atMs":9917,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"wholes"},{"atMs":10249.5,"durationMs":558.5,"text":"first"}],"durationMs":10808},
