    "So the direct fraction is twelve eighths.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-ad4c8baec972a88e.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"So"},{"atMs":326.1,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":445.8,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"direct"},{"atMs":844.7,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"fraction"},{"atMs":1310.1,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1469.7,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"twelve"},{"atMs":1881.9,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"eighths"}],"durationMs":2347},
    "So the first job is not adding. It is making the part sizes match.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-490b4c2b249d7542.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"So"},{"atMs":339.4,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":445.8,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"first"},{"atMs":831.4,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"job"},{"atMs":1097.3,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1270.2,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"not"},{"atMs":1522.9,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"adding"},{"atMs":2776.1,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"It"},{"atMs":2988.8,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"is"},{"atMs":3121.8,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"making"},{"atMs":3507.5,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3600.5,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"part"},{"atMs":3933,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"sizes"},{"atMs":4371.8,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"match"}],"durationMs":4877},
    "So the length is thirteen quarters of a metre. Correct — but awkward to picture.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-dcb113aa3cd6a5a1.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"So"},{"atMs":339.4,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":459,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"length"},{"atMs":791.5,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"is"},{"atMs":991,"durationMs":492,"text":"thirteen"},{"atMs":1496.3,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"quarters"},{"atMs":1935.1,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"of"},{"atMs":2028.2,"durationMs":53.2,"text":"a"},{"atMs":2094.7,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"metre"},{"atMs":3480.8,"durationMs":571.8,"text":"Correct"},{"atMs":4252.1,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"but"},{"atMs":4411.7,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"awkward"},{"atMs":4810.6,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"to"},{"atMs":4903.7,"durationMs":571.8,"text":"picture"}],"durationMs":5476},
