    "The denominator tells how many equal pieces make the whole.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-65bbc63cd870bd41.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"The"},{"atMs":272.9,"durationMs":664.9,"text":"denominator"},{"atMs":951.1,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"tells"},{"atMs":1350,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"how"},{"atMs":1509.6,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"many"},{"atMs":1735.6,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"equal"},{"atMs":2161.2,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"pieces"},{"atMs":2573.4,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"make"},{"atMs":2812.8,"durationMs":66.5,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2892.5,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"whole"}],"durationMs":3371},
    "The denominator tells us how many parts make one whole. Here, five fifths make a whole.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-4fbbef08741df81a.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"The"},{"atMs":272.9,"durationMs":651.6,"text":"denominator"},{"atMs":937.8,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"tells"},{"atMs":1323.4,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"us"},{"atMs":1443.1,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"how"},{"atMs":1629.2,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"many"},{"atMs":1881.9,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"parts"},{"atMs":2294.2,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"make"},{"atMs":2546.8,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"one"},{"atMs":2772.9,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"whole"},{"atMs":4198.9,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"Here"},{"atMs":4810.6,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"five"},{"atMs":5143.1,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"fifths"},{"atMs":5528.7,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"make"},{"atMs":5768.1,"durationMs":39.9,"text":"a"},{"atMs":5821.3,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"whole"}],"durationMs":6353},
