    "The numerator is four. Take four equal shares: five, ten, fifteen, twenty.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-ed749d049a7e7927.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"The"},{"atMs":286.2,"durationMs":678.2,"text":"numerator"},{"atMs":977.7,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1150.5,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"four"},{"atMs":2510.1,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"Take"},{"atMs":2829.2,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"four"},{"atMs":3002.1,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"equal"},{"atMs":3427.7,"durationMs":518.6,"text":"shares"},{"atMs":4145.8,"durationMs":492,"text":"five"},{"atMs":4930.3,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"ten"},{"atMs":5648.4,"durationMs":598.4,"text":"fifteen"},{"atMs":6446.3,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"twenty"}],"durationMs":6925},
    "The numerator is not smaller than the denominator. Six sixths is still an improper fraction, and its value is exactly one.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-4d20ed827e3240ef.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"The"},{"atMs":286.2,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"numerator"},{"atMs":911.2,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1137.2,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"not"},{"atMs":1376.6,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"smaller"},{"atMs":1788.8,"durationMs":133,"text":"than"},{"atMs":1935.1,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2028.2,"durationMs":824.5,"text":"denominator"},{"atMs":3773.4,"durationMs":359,"text":"Six"},{"atMs":4145.8,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"sixths"},{"atMs":4611.2,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"is"},{"atMs":4770.8,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"still"},{"atMs":5023.4,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"an"},{"atMs":5116.5,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"improper"},{"atMs":5568.6,"durationMs":518.6,"text":"fraction"},{"atMs":6353.2,"durationMs":133,"text":"and"},{"atMs":6499.5,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"its"},{"atMs":6659,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"value"},{"atMs":7111.2,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"is"},{"atMs":7284,"durationMs":492,"text":"exactly"},{"atMs":7789.4,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"one"}],"durationMs":8188},
