    "The numerator is smaller, so the value is less than one.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-bc86bf509491ed0f.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"The"},{"atMs":286.2,"durationMs":625,"text":"numerator"},{"atMs":924.5,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1137.2,"durationMs":492,"text":"smaller"},{"atMs":1881.9,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"so"},{"atMs":2001.6,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2094.7,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"value"},{"atMs":2546.8,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"is"},{"atMs":2719.7,"durationMs":266,"text":"less"},{"atMs":2998.9,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"than"},{"atMs":3171.8,"durationMs":359,"text":"one"}],"durationMs":3531},
