    "The order and simplest form are both right. Now check the reduction from twenty-one twenty-eighths.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-09ecbb6830033de2.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"The"},{"atMs":299.5,"durationMs":359,"text":"order"},{"atMs":671.8,"durationMs":133,"text":"and"},{"atMs":818.1,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"simplest"},{"atMs":1310.1,"durationMs":266,"text":"form"},{"atMs":1589.4,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"are"},{"atMs":1709,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"both"},{"atMs":2068.1,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"right"},{"atMs":3441,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"Now"},{"atMs":3786.7,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"check"},{"atMs":4052.7,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":4159,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"reduction"},{"atMs":4704.2,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"from"},{"atMs":4903.7,"durationMs":664.9,"text":"twenty-one"},{"atMs":5581.9,"durationMs":824.5,"text":"twenty-eighths"}],"durationMs":6406},
