    "The remainder, four, is the leftover numerator.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-9d3e321afaff76f7.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"The"},{"atMs":286.2,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"remainder"},{"atMs":1017.5,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"four"},{"atMs":1443.1,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1562.8,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1682.5,"durationMs":598.4,"text":"leftover"},{"atMs":2294.2,"durationMs":784.6,"text":"numerator"}],"durationMs":3079},
    "The ribbon has more parts now, so keeping only two coloured parts shortens the endpoint.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-1a858de064f062a1.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"The"},{"atMs":312.8,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"ribbon"},{"atMs":631.9,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"has"},{"atMs":844.7,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"more"},{"atMs":1084,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"parts"},{"atMs":1536.2,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"now"},{"atMs":2134.6,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"so"},{"atMs":2294.2,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"keeping"},{"atMs":2706.4,"durationMs":266,"text":"only"},{"atMs":2985.6,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"two"},{"atMs":3238.3,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"coloured"},{"atMs":3584,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"parts"},{"atMs":3943.1,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"shortens"},{"atMs":4408.5,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"the"},{"atMs":4568.1,"durationMs":678.2,"text":"endpoint"}],"durationMs":5246},
