    "Three quarters is forty-five sixtieths.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-ffa22be552c64eab.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":359,"text":"Three"},{"atMs":472.3,"durationMs":492,"text":"quarters"},{"atMs":977.7,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1163.8,"durationMs":758,"text":"forty-five"},{"atMs":1935.1,"durationMs":718.1,"text":"sixtieths"}],"durationMs":2653},
    "Three quarters is less than one metre, but the answer is six. Dividing by a small fraction can make the result bigger.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-f9126ed91d55c2b9.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"Three"},{"atMs":459,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"quarters"},{"atMs":924.5,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1110.6,"durationMs":266,"text":"less"},{"atMs":1389.9,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"than"},{"atMs":1576.1,"durationMs":266,"text":"one"},{"atMs":1855.3,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"metre"},{"atMs":2360.6,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"but"},{"atMs":2493.6,"durationMs":133,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2639.9,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"answer"},{"atMs":3052.1,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"is"},{"atMs":3238.3,"durationMs":492,"text":"six"},{"atMs":4651.1,"durationMs":545.2,"text":"Dividing"},{"atMs":5209.6,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"by"},{"atMs":5422.3,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"a"},{"atMs":5515.4,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"small"},{"atMs":5901.1,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"fraction"},{"atMs":6393.1,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"can"},{"atMs":6579.2,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"make"},{"atMs":6792,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":6885.1,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"result"},{"atMs":7310.6,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"bigger"}],"durationMs":7736},
    "Three quarters is the starting amount, so it becomes six eighths first.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-292107421bb9b9b1.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"Three"},{"atMs":445.8,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"quarters"},{"atMs":911.2,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"is"},{"atMs":1044.2,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1163.8,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"starting"},{"atMs":1655.8,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"amount"},{"atMs":2280.8,"durationMs":133,"text":"so"},{"atMs":2427.1,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"it"},{"atMs":2533.5,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"becomes"},{"atMs":2959,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"six"},{"atMs":3264.9,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"eighths"},{"atMs":3584,"durationMs":558.5,"text":"first"}],"durationMs":4142},
    "Three quarters minus five eighths. Eight is a multiple of four, so three quarters becomes six eighths.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-dfd21acb7e58b225.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"Three"},{"atMs":459,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"quarters"},{"atMs":911.2,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"minus"},{"atMs":1310.1,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"five"},{"atMs":1722.3,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"eighths"},{"atMs":3121.8,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"Eight"},{"atMs":3414.4,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"is"},{"atMs":3547.3,"durationMs":53.2,"text":"a"},{"atMs":3613.8,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"multiple"},{"atMs":4132.5,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"of"},{"atMs":4225.5,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"four"},{"atMs":4877.1,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"so"},{"atMs":5050,"durationMs":266,"text":"three"},{"atMs":5329.2,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"quarters"},{"atMs":5808,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"becomes"},{"atMs":6246.8,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"six"},{"atMs":6552.7,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"eighths"}],"durationMs":7058},
    "Three quarters times one eighth makes a tiny part. It does not count how many one-eighth groups fit.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-5e4532edfb39a719.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":359,"text":"Three"},{"atMs":472.3,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"quarters"},{"atMs":924.5,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"times"},{"atMs":1310.1,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"one"},{"atMs":1616,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"eighth"},{"atMs":1908.5,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"makes"},{"atMs":2214.4,"durationMs":66.5,"text":"a"},{"atMs":2294.2,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"tiny"},{"atMs":2733,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"part"},{"atMs":4185.6,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"It"},{"atMs":4411.7,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"does"},{"atMs":4597.9,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"not"},{"atMs":4784,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"count"},{"atMs":5076.6,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"how"},{"atMs":5249.5,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"many"},{"atMs":5488.8,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"one-eighth"},{"atMs":5967.5,"durationMs":359,"text":"groups"},{"atMs":6339.9,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"fit"}],"durationMs":6686},
    "Three remainder seven cannot be the finished result for nineteen divided by four. Four of those seven quarters make another whole.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-93f738b069717e30.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"Three"},{"atMs":459,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"remainder"},{"atMs":951.1,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"seven"},{"atMs":1296.8,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"cannot"},{"atMs":1655.8,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"be"},{"atMs":1788.8,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1908.5,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"finished"},{"atMs":2294.2,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"result"},{"atMs":2679.8,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"for"},{"atMs":2812.8,"durationMs":571.8,"text":"nineteen"},{"atMs":3397.9,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"divided"},{"atMs":3889.9,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"by"},{"atMs":4129.2,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"four"},{"atMs":5528.7,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"Four"},{"atMs":5754.8,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"of"},{"atMs":5847.9,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"those"},{"atMs":6113.8,"durationMs":266,"text":"seven"},{"atMs":6393.1,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"quarters"},{"atMs":6831.9,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"make"},{"atMs":7058,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"another"},{"atMs":7350.5,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"whole"}],"durationMs":7829},
    "Three tenths is only the fractional part. The separate 4 cannot be ignored.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-813cb315092273a9.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"Three"},{"atMs":432.5,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"tenths"},{"atMs":818.1,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"is"},{"atMs":991,"durationMs":266,"text":"only"},{"atMs":1270.2,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1376.6,"durationMs":558.5,"text":"fractional"},{"atMs":1948.4,"durationMs":518.6,"text":"part"},{"atMs":3387.8,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"The"},{"atMs":3573.9,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"separate"},{"atMs":4026.1,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"4"},{"atMs":4145.8,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"cannot"},{"atMs":4584.6,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"be"},{"atMs":4717.5,"durationMs":678.2,"text":"ignored"}],"durationMs":5396},
