    "Use eight on both numbers. Recalculate thirty-two divided by eight and fifty-six divided by eight.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-9e8b0375cde709a1.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":459,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"eight"},{"atMs":711.7,"durationMs":133,"text":"on"},{"atMs":858,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"both"},{"atMs":1177.1,"durationMs":598.4,"text":"numbers"},{"atMs":2696.3,"durationMs":824.5,"text":"Recalculate"},{"atMs":3534,"durationMs":638.3,"text":"thirty-two"},{"atMs":4185.6,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"divided"},{"atMs":4677.7,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"by"},{"atMs":4877.1,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"eight"},{"atMs":5196.3,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"and"},{"atMs":5302.7,"durationMs":664.9,"text":"fifty-six"},{"atMs":5980.8,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"divided"},{"atMs":6472.9,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"by"},{"atMs":6698.9,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"eight"}],"durationMs":7124},
    "Use eight over one. That turns one-eighth-sized groups into units.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-32c631a0824cb33c.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":432.5,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"eight"},{"atMs":698.4,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"over"},{"atMs":911.2,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"one"},{"atMs":2244.2,"durationMs":266,"text":"That"},{"atMs":2523.4,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"turns"},{"atMs":2869.2,"durationMs":930.8,"text":"one-eighth-sized"},{"atMs":3813.3,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"groups"},{"atMs":4198.9,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"into"},{"atMs":4464.9,"durationMs":678.2,"text":"units"}],"durationMs":5143},
    "Use equal-sized wholes. Ignore the partition lines for a moment and compare where the shaded amount ends.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-f66a76b03b11cefc.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":359,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":472.3,"durationMs":784.6,"text":"equal-sized"},{"atMs":1270.2,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"wholes"},{"atMs":2802.7,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"Ignore"},{"atMs":3228.2,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3347.9,"durationMs":545.2,"text":"partition"},{"atMs":3906.4,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"lines"},{"atMs":4225.5,"durationMs":133,"text":"for"},{"atMs":4371.8,"durationMs":53.2,"text":"a"},{"atMs":4438.3,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"moment"},{"atMs":4850.5,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"and"},{"atMs":4943.6,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"compare"},{"atMs":5355.8,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"where"},{"atMs":5568.6,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"the"},{"atMs":5701.6,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"shaded"},{"atMs":6087.2,"durationMs":359,"text":"amount"},{"atMs":6459.6,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"ends"}],"durationMs":6912},
    "Use fifteen. Only one fraction needs a new name.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-56492ff9a99e26e1.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":485.6,"durationMs":691.5,"text":"fifteen"},{"atMs":2097.9,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"Only"},{"atMs":2443.6,"durationMs":266,"text":"one"},{"atMs":2722.9,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"fraction"},{"atMs":3188.3,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"needs"},{"atMs":3507.5,"durationMs":53.2,"text":"a"},{"atMs":3573.9,"durationMs":266,"text":"new"},{"atMs":3853.2,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"name"}],"durationMs":4332},
    "Use five as the group size. The four is added only after the whole groups are counted.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-f7053e90c5d861c2.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":485.6,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"five"},{"atMs":911.2,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"as"},{"atMs":1004.2,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1110.6,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"group"},{"atMs":1416.5,"durationMs":625,"text":"size"},{"atMs":2962.2,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"The"},{"atMs":3121.8,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"four"},{"atMs":3334.6,"durationMs":133,"text":"is"},{"atMs":3480.8,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"added"},{"atMs":3786.7,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"only"},{"atMs":4079.2,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"after"},{"atMs":4371.8,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":4464.9,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"whole"},{"atMs":4757.5,"durationMs":359,"text":"groups"},{"atMs":5129.8,"durationMs":66.5,"text":"are"},{"atMs":5209.6,"durationMs":625,"text":"counted"}],"durationMs":5835},
    "Use five times three on top and four times seven on the bottom.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-91aee23a28ab7bbd.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":445.8,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"five"},{"atMs":778.2,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"times"},{"atMs":1203.7,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"three"},{"atMs":1522.9,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"on"},{"atMs":1735.6,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"top"},{"atMs":2081.4,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"and"},{"atMs":2187.8,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"four"},{"atMs":2427.1,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"times"},{"atMs":2866,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"seven"},{"atMs":3171.8,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"on"},{"atMs":3291.5,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3384.6,"durationMs":492,"text":"bottom"}],"durationMs":3877},
    "Use five to find one equal share of forty-five metres. Then take two of those shares.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-e1edcc78169ca857.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":459,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"five"},{"atMs":764.9,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"to"},{"atMs":858,"durationMs":359,"text":"find"},{"atMs":1230.3,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"one"},{"atMs":1483,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"equal"},{"atMs":1868.6,"durationMs":266,"text":"share"},{"atMs":2147.9,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"of"},{"atMs":2373.9,"durationMs":718.1,"text":"forty-five"},{"atMs":3105.3,"durationMs":571.8,"text":"metres"},{"atMs":4597.9,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"Then"},{"atMs":4863.8,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"take"},{"atMs":5116.5,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"two"},{"atMs":5369.2,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"of"},{"atMs":5475.5,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"those"},{"atMs":5728.2,"durationMs":598.4,"text":"shares"}],"durationMs":6327},
    "Use five to make the equal shares, then use three to choose how many shares to take.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-533f6f016cd32432.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":485.6,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"five"},{"atMs":791.5,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"to"},{"atMs":897.9,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"make"},{"atMs":1110.6,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1203.7,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"equal"},{"atMs":1616,"durationMs":571.8,"text":"shares"},{"atMs":2427.1,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"then"},{"atMs":2626.6,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"use"},{"atMs":2972.3,"durationMs":266,"text":"three"},{"atMs":3251.6,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"to"},{"atMs":3384.6,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"choose"},{"atMs":3783.5,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"how"},{"atMs":3969.7,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"many"},{"atMs":4262.2,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"shares"},{"atMs":4647.9,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"to"},{"atMs":4754.2,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"take"}],"durationMs":5193},
    "Use four groups of five twelfths and keep the metre unit.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-619c6a3dccda5b2d.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":538.8,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"four"},{"atMs":645.2,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"groups"},{"atMs":1004.2,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"of"},{"atMs":1110.6,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"five"},{"atMs":1469.7,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"twelfths"},{"atMs":1935.1,"durationMs":133,"text":"and"},{"atMs":2081.4,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"keep"},{"atMs":2334,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2427.1,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"metre"},{"atMs":2759.6,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"unit"}],"durationMs":3292},
    "Use multiplication across each row, not addition.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-761de14783b24a74.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":485.6,"durationMs":864.4,"text":"multiplication"},{"atMs":1363.3,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"across"},{"atMs":1762.2,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"each"},{"atMs":2028.2,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"row"},{"atMs":2573.4,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"not"},{"atMs":2812.8,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"addition"}],"durationMs":3345},
