    "Use one factor on both parts. Twenty-four and thirty-six can both divide by twelve, giving two thirds.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-47624a357118c0df.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":498.9,"durationMs":266,"text":"one"},{"atMs":778.2,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"factor"},{"atMs":1177.1,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"on"},{"atMs":1389.9,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"both"},{"atMs":1722.3,"durationMs":638.3,"text":"parts"},{"atMs":3281.4,"durationMs":758,"text":"Twenty-four"},{"atMs":4052.7,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"and"},{"atMs":4185.6,"durationMs":664.9,"text":"thirty-six"},{"atMs":4863.8,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"can"},{"atMs":5076.6,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"both"},{"atMs":5395.8,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"divide"},{"atMs":5808,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"by"},{"atMs":5967.5,"durationMs":598.4,"text":"twelve"},{"atMs":6738.8,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"giving"},{"atMs":7071.3,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"two"},{"atMs":7337.2,"durationMs":651.6,"text":"thirds"}],"durationMs":7989},
    "Use one factor on both the numerator and denominator, every time.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-0fafff0b13e1e301.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":359,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":472.3,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"one"},{"atMs":738.3,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"factor"},{"atMs":1097.3,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"on"},{"atMs":1336.7,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"both"},{"atMs":1655.8,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1762.2,"durationMs":598.4,"text":"numerator"},{"atMs":2373.9,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"and"},{"atMs":2573.4,"durationMs":731.4,"text":"denominator"},{"atMs":3570.8,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"every"},{"atMs":3836.7,"durationMs":518.6,"text":"time"}],"durationMs":4355},
    "Use one half as the checkpoint. Decide where each fraction sits.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-d319dcbb216ab8ed.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":498.9,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"one"},{"atMs":764.9,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"half"},{"atMs":1150.5,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"as"},{"atMs":1256.9,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1363.3,"durationMs":731.4,"text":"checkpoint"},{"atMs":3015.4,"durationMs":492,"text":"Decide"},{"atMs":3520.8,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"where"},{"atMs":3733.5,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"each"},{"atMs":4079.2,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"fraction"},{"atMs":4571.3,"durationMs":518.6,"text":"sits"}],"durationMs":5090},
    "Use one half as the middle anchor. One fraction belongs below it and one belongs above it.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-15a6c42c68aea2cf.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":485.6,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"one"},{"atMs":738.3,"durationMs":359,"text":"half"},{"atMs":1110.6,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"as"},{"atMs":1230.3,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1336.7,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"middle"},{"atMs":1669.2,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"anchor"},{"atMs":3015.4,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"One"},{"atMs":3361.2,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"fraction"},{"atMs":3800,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"belongs"},{"atMs":4225.5,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"below"},{"atMs":4558,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"it"},{"atMs":4730.8,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"and"},{"atMs":4850.5,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"one"},{"atMs":5076.6,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"belongs"},{"atMs":5528.7,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"above"},{"atMs":5821.3,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"it"}],"durationMs":6074},
    "Use one half before choosing the symbol. The fractions lie on opposite sides.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-5b1854a3f1e43917.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":485.6,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"one"},{"atMs":778.2,"durationMs":359,"text":"half"},{"atMs":1150.5,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"before"},{"atMs":1536.2,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"choosing"},{"atMs":2001.6,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2094.7,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"symbol"},{"atMs":3467.5,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"The"},{"atMs":3627.1,"durationMs":545.2,"text":"fractions"},{"atMs":4185.6,"durationMs":266,"text":"lie"},{"atMs":4464.9,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"on"},{"atMs":4624.5,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"opposite"},{"atMs":5116.5,"durationMs":691.5,"text":"sides"}],"durationMs":5808},
    "Use one half to place each fraction, then choose the symbol.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-faccbf17125d6257.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"Use"},{"atMs":498.9,"durationMs":266,"text":"one"},{"atMs":778.2,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"half"},{"atMs":1097.3,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"to"},{"atMs":1203.7,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"place"},{"atMs":1522.9,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"each"},{"atMs":1762.2,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"fraction"},{"atMs":2467,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"then"},{"atMs":2653.2,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"choose"},{"atMs":3012.2,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3118.6,"durationMs":492,"text":"symbol"}],"durationMs":3611},
