    "Whatever factor changes the denominator must also change the numerator.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-43d992e9669a8e98.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"Whatever"},{"atMs":592,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"factor"},{"atMs":977.7,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"changes"},{"atMs":1456.4,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1576.1,"durationMs":678.2,"text":"denominator"},{"atMs":2267.5,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"must"},{"atMs":2573.4,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"also"},{"atMs":2932.5,"durationMs":359,"text":"change"},{"atMs":3304.8,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3411.2,"durationMs":744.7,"text":"numerator"}],"durationMs":4156},
    "Whatever number you multiply by zero, the product stays zero.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-c0adc4a2a64e1dcb.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"Whatever"},{"atMs":592,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"number"},{"atMs":858,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"you"},{"atMs":991,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"multiply"},{"atMs":1616,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"by"},{"atMs":1842,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"zero"},{"atMs":2626.6,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2746.3,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"product"},{"atMs":3145.2,"durationMs":359,"text":"stays"},{"atMs":3517.5,"durationMs":531.9,"text":"zero"}],"durationMs":4049},
