    "When the denominators match, subtract the numerators in the order shown.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-c3efb4dd6ab54d74.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"When"},{"atMs":366,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":459,"durationMs":704.8,"text":"denominators"},{"atMs":1177.1,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"match"},{"atMs":1748.9,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"subtract"},{"atMs":2227.7,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":2320.8,"durationMs":678.2,"text":"numerators"},{"atMs":3012.2,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"in"},{"atMs":3118.6,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3238.3,"durationMs":305.8,"text":"order"},{"atMs":3557.5,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"shown"}],"durationMs":4063},
    "When the denominators match, the pieces already have the same size.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-3bf1cf2679d95c2e.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":266,"text":"When"},{"atMs":379.2,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":472.3,"durationMs":731.4,"text":"denominators"},{"atMs":1217,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"match"},{"atMs":1828.7,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":1935.1,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"pieces"},{"atMs":2320.8,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"already"},{"atMs":2719.7,"durationMs":226.1,"text":"have"},{"atMs":2959,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3065.4,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"same"},{"atMs":3424.5,"durationMs":625,"text":"size"}],"durationMs":4050},
    "When the instruction says 'by a factor of five', we carry out that one exact step and stop.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-6889e9dae1ab4c5e.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"When"},{"atMs":366,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"the"},{"atMs":485.6,"durationMs":558.5,"text":"instruction"},{"atMs":1057.5,"durationMs":266,"text":"says"},{"atMs":1416.5,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"by"},{"atMs":1602.7,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"a"},{"atMs":1695.8,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"factor"},{"atMs":2147.9,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"of"},{"atMs":2254.2,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"five"},{"atMs":2892.5,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"we"},{"atMs":3012.2,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"carry"},{"atMs":3397.9,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"out"},{"atMs":3570.8,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"that"},{"atMs":3743.6,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"one"},{"atMs":3943.1,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"exact"},{"atMs":4368.6,"durationMs":345.8,"text":"step"},{"atMs":4727.7,"durationMs":106.4,"text":"and"},{"atMs":4847.3,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"stop"}],"durationMs":5326},
    "When the numerator divides exactly, you can divide the numerator and keep the denominator.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-ae062c8c0a2b1ff3.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"When"},{"atMs":392.5,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":485.6,"durationMs":571.8,"text":"numerator"},{"atMs":1070.8,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"divides"},{"atMs":1549.5,"durationMs":571.8,"text":"exactly"},{"atMs":2387.2,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"you"},{"atMs":2480.3,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"can"},{"atMs":2613.3,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"divide"},{"atMs":3025.5,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":3118.6,"durationMs":598.4,"text":"numerator"},{"atMs":3730.3,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"and"},{"atMs":3903.2,"durationMs":266,"text":"keep"},{"atMs":4182.5,"durationMs":79.8,"text":"the"},{"atMs":4275.5,"durationMs":811.2,"text":"denominator"}],"durationMs":5087},
