    "Yes. Five is smaller than nine, so five ninths is less than one and is proper.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-d22ebd2ae137a577.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"Yes"},{"atMs":1632.5,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"Five"},{"atMs":2111.2,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"is"},{"atMs":2270.8,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"smaller"},{"atMs":2656.4,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"than"},{"atMs":2842.5,"durationMs":359,"text":"nine"},{"atMs":3321.3,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"so"},{"atMs":3480.8,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"five"},{"atMs":3893.1,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"ninths"},{"atMs":4278.7,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"is"},{"atMs":4451.6,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"less"},{"atMs":4744.2,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"than"},{"atMs":4917,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"one"},{"atMs":5183,"durationMs":133,"text":"and"},{"atMs":5329.2,"durationMs":133,"text":"is"},{"atMs":5475.5,"durationMs":438.8,"text":"proper"}],"durationMs":5914},
    "Yes. Five one-sixth units fit, so five sixths divided by one sixth is five.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-e1bbb96a1bb59eab.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"Yes"},{"atMs":1632.5,"durationMs":505.3,"text":"Five"},{"atMs":2151.1,"durationMs":598.4,"text":"one-sixth"},{"atMs":2762.8,"durationMs":359,"text":"units"},{"atMs":3135.1,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"fit"},{"atMs":3653.7,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"so"},{"atMs":3853.2,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"five"},{"atMs":4238.8,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"sixths"},{"atMs":4651.1,"durationMs":518.6,"text":"divided"},{"atMs":5183,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"by"},{"atMs":5369.2,"durationMs":332.5,"text":"one"},{"atMs":5714.9,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"sixth"},{"atMs":6100.5,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"is"},{"atMs":6233.5,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"five"}],"durationMs":6845},
    "Yes. Five thirteenths plus three thirteenths is eight thirteenths.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-78264740e0571fa6.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"Yes"},{"atMs":1632.5,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"Five"},{"atMs":2058,"durationMs":558.5,"text":"thirteenths"},{"atMs":2629.8,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"plus"},{"atMs":2962.2,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"three"},{"atMs":3214.9,"durationMs":598.4,"text":"thirteenths"},{"atMs":3826.6,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"is"},{"atMs":4012.8,"durationMs":186.2,"text":"eight"},{"atMs":4212.2,"durationMs":758,"text":"thirteenths"}],"durationMs":4970},
