    "Yes. Four elevenths plus three elevenths is seven elevenths of a metre.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-f11a27f6a5dc4d01.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"Yes"},{"atMs":1632.5,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"Four"},{"atMs":1858.5,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"elevenths"},{"atMs":2323.9,"durationMs":319.2,"text":"plus"},{"atMs":2656.4,"durationMs":239.4,"text":"three"},{"atMs":2909,"durationMs":425.5,"text":"elevenths"},{"atMs":3347.9,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"is"},{"atMs":3560.6,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"seven"},{"atMs":3853.2,"durationMs":478.7,"text":"elevenths"},{"atMs":4345.2,"durationMs":93.1,"text":"of"},{"atMs":4451.6,"durationMs":53.2,"text":"a"},{"atMs":4518.1,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"metre"}],"durationMs":4970},
    "Yes. Four elevenths plus two elevenths is six elevenths.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-1eae55a6a6134414.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"Yes"},{"atMs":1632.5,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"Four"},{"atMs":1858.5,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"elevenths"},{"atMs":2337.2,"durationMs":292.5,"text":"plus"},{"atMs":2643.1,"durationMs":199.5,"text":"two"},{"atMs":2855.8,"durationMs":452.1,"text":"elevenths"},{"atMs":3321.3,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"is"},{"atMs":3547.3,"durationMs":252.7,"text":"six"},{"atMs":3813.3,"durationMs":638.3,"text":"elevenths"}],"durationMs":4452},
    "Yes. Four equal section-lengths fit.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-ab4838e34db7e1f0.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"Yes"},{"atMs":1632.5,"durationMs":212.8,"text":"Four"},{"atMs":1858.5,"durationMs":398.9,"text":"equal"},{"atMs":2270.8,"durationMs":718.1,"text":"section-lengths"},{"atMs":3002.1,"durationMs":385.6,"text":"fit"}],"durationMs":3388},
