    "Yes. Twenty-eight fortieths is greater than twenty-five fortieths.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-ffacaf927fc1ad17.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"Yes"},{"atMs":1632.5,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"Twenty-eight"},{"atMs":2257.5,"durationMs":558.5,"text":"fortieths"},{"atMs":2829.2,"durationMs":133,"text":"is"},{"atMs":2975.5,"durationMs":412.2,"text":"greater"},{"atMs":3401.1,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"than"},{"atMs":3573.9,"durationMs":704.8,"text":"twenty-five"},{"atMs":4292,"durationMs":744.7,"text":"fortieths"}],"durationMs":5037},
    "Yes. Twenty-four can be split into eighths and sixths exactly.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-744b7218af491a1a.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"Yes"},{"atMs":1632.5,"durationMs":625,"text":"Twenty-four"},{"atMs":2270.8,"durationMs":159.6,"text":"can"},{"atMs":2443.6,"durationMs":119.7,"text":"be"},{"atMs":2576.6,"durationMs":359,"text":"split"},{"atMs":2948.9,"durationMs":279.2,"text":"into"},{"atMs":3241.5,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"eighths"},{"atMs":3627.1,"durationMs":133,"text":"and"},{"atMs":3773.4,"durationMs":492,"text":"sixths"},{"atMs":4278.7,"durationMs":598.4,"text":"exactly"}],"durationMs":4877},
    "Yes. Twenty-four divided by six is four.": {"src":"/fractions/audio/ryan-1ccb372a1b912ed3.mp3","words":[{"atMs":100,"durationMs":611.7,"text":"Yes"},{"atMs":1632.5,"durationMs":625,"text":"Twenty-four"},{"atMs":2270.8,"durationMs":492,"text":"divided"},{"atMs":2776.1,"durationMs":172.9,"text":"by"},{"atMs":2962.2,"durationMs":372.3,"text":"six"},{"atMs":3347.9,"durationMs":146.3,"text":"is"},{"atMs":3507.5,"durationMs":465.4,"text":"four"}],"durationMs":3973},
